              <SubComponents>
                <Component class="javax.swing.JTextArea" name="jTextArea3">
                  <Properties>
                    <Property name="background" type="java.awt.Color" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.ColorEditor">
                      <Color blue="0" green="99" red="ff" type="rgb"/>
                    </Property>
                    <Property name="columns" type="int" value="20"/>
                    <Property name="font" type="java.awt.Font" editor="org.netbeans.beaninfo.editors.FontEditor">
                      <Font name="Segoe UI" size="18" style="2"/>
                    </Property>
                    <Property name="rows" type="int" value="5"/>
                    <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Rising foood and fuel prices  due to ongoing wars have impacted and contributed to record levels of hunger. Displaced people &#xa;have to find more and more ways to obtain nutritous food to survive.  Some within you local communites. It&apos;s time for that to &#xa;change. Within your communites you can make a difference to one or more people . Sign-up to volunteer enter your address&#xa;and you will be given .A delivery location and a collectionpoint. You&apos;ll be able make multiple deliveries to help a multitude of&#xa;people to connect and bring the community closer.&#xa;&#xa;SIGN-UP NOW!!!!!!!!"/>
                  </Properties>
                </Component>
              </SubComponents>
            </Container>
