                    <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Thank you for for service !!! Your dilligence and willingness&#xa; to help is above all amazing. But we hope you do not stop here. &#xa;There is an oopurtunity to change multiple lives.&#xa;You can now make more than one delivery. &#xa;And anytime you get to this page you can&#xa;count how many deliveries you&apos;ve made.&#xa;With a certain amount of deliveries, you could be eligiblefor&#xa;an award given to you by the UN. This is a massive prospect&#xa;and net postive for both you and your community.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;So go on an make those deliveries!!!"/>
